      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": true,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 38,
      "text": "αφού ƒ Ε Ι έχουμε tf ∈ tⅠ. Όμοια f ∈ Jάρα (1 − t)f ∈ (1 − t)J. Άρα",
      "font_size": 34,
      "fitted_size": 34,
      "panel_xy": [
        239,
        1743.4
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        2019,
        1783.4
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": true,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 39,
      "text": "f = tf + (1 − t)f ∈ tI + (1 − t)J. Τώρα αφού I, J C k[x1,..., Χη] έχουμε ότι",
      "font_size": 34,
      "fitted_size": 34,
      "panel_xy": [
        241,
        1783.4
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        2021,
        1823.4
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": false,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 40,
      "text": "f∈ (tI+(1-t)J)∩k[x1,..., xn]. Άρα INJ C (tI+(1-t)J)∩k[x1,..., Χη]. Από",
      "font_size": 34,
      "fitted_size": 34,
      "panel_xy": [
        242,
        1822.9
      ],
      "canvas_xy": [
        2022,
        1862.9
      ],
      "tall": false,
      "low_confidence": true,
      "overflow_at_minimum": false
    },
    {
      "line_number": 41,
      "text": "την άλλη έστω f ∈ (tI+(1-t)J)∩k[x1,..., xn]. Τότε f(x) = g(x, t)+h(x, t) όπου",
      "font_size": 34,
      "fitted_size": 34,
      "panel_xy": [
